# Loaded by `vite build` for production (Cloudflare Pages). Nothing here is secret.
#
# Stock writes go through the trusted server commands (ADR-001, functions/api/stock/*).
# Safe before the server is set up: without FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT the commands answer
# 503 and the app files on its client path as before. Once firestore.rules closes client
# stock writes (docs/evidence/phase-a-sec.md), this must stay `all`.
VITE_STOCK_COMMANDS=all
